| `bb test:cljd` (after deleting `test/cljd-out`) | "All tests passed!" at +2452 |

In `bb test:clj`, the only skip notice is the old `ws-project-peer` one.

**To land it**, someone with git permission runs:
`git add src/cljc/yin/repl/query.cljc && git commit --amend --no-edit`

